{"id":"e26933a629751c0c","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md","title":"Provability Predicate (Bew)","display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate (Bew)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-provability-predicate","aliases":["58-df-provability-predicate","58-df-bew"],"display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate (Bew)","depends_on":["[[../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-provable.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-provability-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-provability-predicate</span><span>58-df-bew</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate (Bew)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" href=\"?note=a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md\">../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"582b96e73e5d1c6e\" href=\"?note=582b96e73e5d1c6e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-provable.md\">../batch08/58-df-provable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof.md\">../batch04/58-df-proof.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,x)\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (一阶公式集, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> (fixed proof system) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof.md\">../batch04/58-df-proof.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" href=\"?note=a2b0a7eb56fecb6a\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md\">../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)^n\\hookrightarrow\\omega\">\\(s:\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)^n\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\)</span> (fixed injective coding of finite formula sequences)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in \\omega\">\\(x \\in \\omega\\)</span> (编码参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\omega\">\\(p\\in\\omega\\)</span> (proof-code parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span> (standard model of arithmetic)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span> (可证性, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"582b96e73e5d1c6e\" href=\"?note=582b96e73e5d1c6e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-provable.md\">../batch08/58-df-provable.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}proof\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\\land s:\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)^n\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\land p,x\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\pi\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)^n\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\Bigl(s(\\pi)=p\\land g(\\varphi)=x\\land\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}proof\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,x)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{GodelNumbering}_S(g,\\Sigma)\\land s:\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)^n\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\land p,x\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\pi\\in\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)^n\\;\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\Bigl(s(\\pi)=p\\land g(\\varphi)=x\\land\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Bew}_T(x) \\leftrightarrow x\\in\\omega\\land\\exists p\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate} \\vdash \\mathrm{Bew}_T(x) \\leftrightarrow x\\in\\omega\\land\\exists p\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_T(x)\\)</span> is the provability predicate for theory <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span></li>\n<li>The context fixes <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,T,\\mathcal P,g,s\">\\(\\Sigma,T,\\mathcal P,g,s\\)</span>; the subscript <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> suppresses these declared coding parameters rather than hiding them.</li>\n<li>The internal formula quantifies over proof codes; it does not contain the external metatheoretic relation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Correctness in the standard model is the metatheorem <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\">\\(T\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Bew}_T(\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\)</span>; it is not a second defining clause for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_T\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For an effectively axiomatized theory <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span> is primitive recursive and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}_T\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1^0\">\\(\\Sigma_1^0\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md","status":"resolved","id":"a2b0a7eb56fecb6a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-provable.md","status":"resolved","id":"582b96e73e5d1c6e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-provable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-proof.md","status":"resolved","id":"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma$ (signature, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (一阶公式集, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-proof.md","status":"resolved","id":"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$ (fixed proof system) and $\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma)$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-godel-numbering.md","status":"resolved","id":"a2b